## Read before you act

Before editing, read the `docs/` file for the area you're touching (see **Start
here**). For multi-step work (more than two files / modules), create an execution
plan in `docs/exec-plans/active/` **before** editing and work from it. Your
SessionStart brief surfaces the active plan and these rules every session; the
plan gate (`scripts/require_plan.py`, on by default) enforces it.

